    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "AI",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104942124311540932841/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKaoHuzeGstrxXl3xrVdOlSBHQzGKa4p8Y0zD9_NTQJ6xQNCA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "April 26 3024\n3yrs ago this place was an amazing place to hangout with family and friends during covid.\n\nJohn and his wife were awesome. Since he retired, this place is not the same anymore.\n\nThey recently change some of the mat and the tees now are too short.\nElse than that, love to be there in the evening with a nice summer breeze.\n\nPutting and chipping area available\nSmall little grass section.",
        "time": 1747485015,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "c carvalho (get_lost_in_my_world)",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114317703636496020699/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxFimUKVPOqcM0OkMJmIENiz3LHITGX0RubZefLmaa4gN5Uz8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful driving range. I have not been to others so there is no comparison in this review. Just a pure observation of how the vistas met my eyes. The service was excellent and the people you run into are extremely pleasant",
        "time": 1759635701,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Rick Lee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103688879397837233535/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEQpQhX9YdT__LzNottxIeeeX-4hJ22Zyf4kV6Ao_fjQrCYUqO=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "This is a gem of a driving range.   I live in Kirkland and it is worth the drive to go here.  John the manager is very friendly and does a great job.  The conditions are excellent.  There is a 'green' to chip onto and the matts are well taken care of. The grass is very green and it is a pleasant environment.  The range is lit for night hitting depending on the season. The picture was taken in lower light and you can see the range is well lit.",
        "time": 1634773467,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Haresh Rana",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115009134375888096955/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV6BavpsAmPDnE_4Fq1NmJ0-iJsuLZhwFYYlD-hSlRpvr3bw7B7cg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very nice and beautiful place for enjoying morning walks!!!",
        "time": 1728389418,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marc Capinpin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111095978828751854816/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL7zAtrv4nL6_egMW7Kf8_1rlnfXEJYSABnipsUZCCaegbDCA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Went there with my cousins and friends. We were about 9 but only 6 of us wanted to try the drive range (is that what its called?). Person at the desk was so kind. Charged us for 6 people but gave us 7 buckets to have the other 3 try! He even proceeded to give us 3 more buckets later because the dispenser jammed! He didnt have to but it was an amazing experience. Thank you",
        "time": 1565575468,
        "translated": false
      }
